* ============================================================================
* 16_attention_mechanism.do — Table 3 mediation (bank_fintech_attention / P2)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
* Plan: §5.5.2 P2 mechanism — Baron-Kenny 1986 mediation + Imai-Keele-Tingley 2010 sensitivity
*
*   X       = {{MAIN_TREAT}}      (attention_index_full)
*   M       = ln_fintech_mdna_length  (P2 mediator.primary, MD&A 章节文本长度)
*   Y       = {{MAIN_DV}}           (ln_fintech_investment)
*
* Baron-Kenny 四步法:
*   (1) Y ~ X     (total effect, c)
*   (2) M ~ X     (a path)
*   (3) Y ~ X + M (c' direct + b indirect)
*   (4) Sobel z = a*b / sqrt(b²σ²_a + a²σ²_b)
* + Imai-Keele-Tingley 2010 敏感性分析: medsens (令残差间相关系数 ρ 变动)。
* 白话: 先看媒体注意力是否影响 fintech 投资 (总效应), 再看是否经"年报 MD&A 里谈 fintech
* 的篇幅"这条中间渠道传导; Sobel z 检验中介效应是否显著, medsens 检验该结论的敏感性。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off
set maxvar 32767
set linesize 120

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* Step 1: 总效应 Y ~ X
reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
eststo total

* Step 2: a 路径 M ~ X
capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
if !_rc {
    reghdfe ln_fintech_mdna_length {{MAIN_TREAT}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo apath
}
else {
    display "  [WARN] ln_fintech_mdna_length not in panel (M0.5.11 enrichment pending)"
}

* Step 3: c' 直接效应 + b 间接效应: Y ~ X + M
capture confirm variable ln_fintech_mdna_length
if !_rc {
    reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}} {{MAIN_TREAT}} ln_fintech_mdna_length $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    eststo direct
}

* Step 4: Sobel z + Imai-Keele 2010 敏感性分析
* 注: medsens 命令需要 Imai 的 `medsens` SSC 包; 安装见 §5.7.3 SSC prerequisites
* (M2 onboarding 时执行)。
* ssc install medsens, replace
* medsens, sims(1000) rho(-0.5 0.5)

* fix(omni-g-templates-07, 2026-06-11): esttab 名单动态化 — apath/direct 被
* ln_fintech_mdna_length 守卫跳过时旧版硬点名 r(111) 静默丢整表
qui estimates dir
local stored `r(names)'
local cand_models total apath direct
local cand_titles `""Total Y~X" "a-path M~X" "Direct Y~X+M""'
local models ""
local mtitles `""'
local nmod : word count `cand_models'
forvalues i = 1/`nmod' {
    local m : word `i' of `cand_models'
    if `: list m in stored' {
        local models `models' `m'
        local t : word `i' of `cand_titles'
        local mtitles `"`mtitles' "`t'""'
    }
}
esttab `models' using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex", replace ///
    star(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) se booktabs label compress b(3) ///
    title("Table 3 — Mechanism (Baron-Kenny mediation; P2 attention → MD&A → investment)") ///
    mtitles(`mtitles') ///
    addnotes("Mediator = ln\_fintech\_mdna\_length (per spec mediator.primary R8-M01)." ///
             "Sobel z + Imai-Keele 2010 sensitivity (rho ∈ [-0.5, +0.5]) in medsens.log.")

* fix(omni-g-esttab-csv, 2026-06-11): CSV side-channel — tables.py:build_table3_mechanism
* 经 read_paper_esttab(...,'table3_mechanism.csv') 消费 (parse_esttab_csv 格式)
estout `models' using "$tables_dir/table3_mechanism.csv", replace delimiter(",") ///
    cells(b(star fmt(3)) se(par fmt(3))) stats(N r2, fmt(0 3)) ///
    starlevels(* 0.10 ** 0.05 *** 0.01) mlabels(`mtitles')

display "[OK] Table 3 (mechanism) → $tables_dir/table3_mechanism.tex (+ .csv side-channel)"
